    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No direct use, but I’d imagine tools like step-by-step solvers (e.g., for equations) or chatbots could be helpful. Since my background isn’t heavy in pure math, practical applications might feel more intuitive than theoretical ones. AI could bridge gaps where memory lags—like reminding me of formulas—but I’d worry about over-reliance on shortcuts.",
